-- הסכם קיבוצי מיום 19.7.2011 (הסתדרות המורים) — קצובת ביגוד לעובדי הוראה:
-- every teaching-scale employee of the State is paid the clothing
-- allowance at level 4 from the allowance paid with the salary of July
-- 2011, whatever his professional seniority (§2); the rise is part of the
-- understandings toward the agreement completing the base agreement of
-- 25.12.2008, and if that agreement is not signed by 30.6.2012 the old
-- rules return and the July 2011 difference is repaid (§3); exhaustion and
-- industrial peace (§§4–5).
--
-- WHO APPLIES IT: the deferral agreement of 22.7.2013 computes the payments
-- it protects on the clothing allowance "by the collective agreements on the
-- eve" of itself, this one among them, and imports this file. The levels'
-- amounts are the Accountant General's (set elsewhere), and the rules in
-- force on the eve of this one are earlier agreements' the corpus does not
-- hold: where they would answer, the level is NOTHING. Held to the
-- completion agreement of 29.2.2012 (its signing day decides §3) in
-- l4/tests/2011-07-19_teachers_bigud-rama-4-all-hora-workers-tests.l4.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT vocabulary

§ `הסכם קיבוצי — קצובת ביגוד לעובדי הוראה (הסתדרות המורים, 19.7.2011)`

DECLARE `2011 clothing agreement action` IS ONE OF
    `repay the July 2011 clothing difference`
    `set off the July 2011 clothing difference from the salary`
    `strike over the 2011 clothing allowance`
    `lock out over the 2011 clothing allowance`

-- akn:preamble The agreement's frame: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:preamble/p1 The document's title; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p2 The registration stamp's heading; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p3 The registration stamp: "this collective agreement was registered as by law"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p4 The registration stamp's day, 15.1.2012; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p5 The registration stamp's number, handwritten and partly illegible; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p6 The registration stamp's signatory; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p7 The registration stamp's signatory's office (the chief labour-relations officer); no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p9 "Between"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p10 The State and who represents it (the wages commissioner and/or the Civil Service Commissioner); no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p11 The State's short name; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p12 "On the one side"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p13 "And"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p14 הסתדרות המורים and its secretary-general; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p15 The union's short name; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p16 "On the other side"; no rule.

-- ¶8: made and signed on 19.7.2011, the day and the month written in by
-- hand. (The fax banner on both pages prints 18 July 2011, a day earlier:
-- the copy was faxed before the day it was dated; the corpus dates it by
-- the page's words.)
@ref akn:preamble/p8
`the 2011 clothing agreement was signed on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 19 7 2011

§§ `1 תחולת ההסכם`

-- Every teaching-scale employee in the State's service ("עובדי הוראה").
@ref akn:art_1 akn:art_1/p1
GIVEN `in the teaching scale` IS A BOOLEAN, `employed in the State's service` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 2011 clothing agreement applies to` `in the teaching scale` `employed in the State's service` IF
    `in the teaching scale` AND `employed in the State's service`

§§ `2 קצובת ביגוד לעובדי הוראה`

-- From the clothing allowance paid with the salary of July 2011, every
-- teaching employee is entitled to the allowance at level 4, whatever his
-- professional seniority. Before it the level is the rules' in force on the
-- eve, which the corpus does not hold (NOTHING here).
@ref akn:art_2 akn:art_2/p1
GIVEN `paid with the salary of` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the clothing level by §2 of 2011` `paid with the salary of` IS
    IF `paid with the salary of` `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 7 2011)
    THEN JUST 4
    ELSE NOTHING

`why the clothing rules on the eve of 19.7.2011 are not here` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "כללי קצובת הביגוד לעובדי הוראה שנהגו ערב חתימת ההסכם מיום 19.7.2011 (רמה לפי ותק מקצועי)"

`why the clothing levels' amounts are not here` MEANS
    `set elsewhere` "החשב הכללי (סכומי קצובת הביגוד לכל רמה)"

§§ `3 ביטול הזכאות`

-- ¶1: the rise is only part of the understandings toward the agreement
-- completing and amending the base agreement of 25.12.2008 ("הסכם
-- ההשלמה"); if by 30.6.2012 they are not all reached and it is not signed,
-- what follows applies. "עד ליום 30.6.2012" includes that day (convention
-- dates.end).
@ref akn:art_3 akn:art_3/p1
`the completion agreement is due by` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 30 6 2012

GIVEN `the completion agreement was signed on` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `§3 of the 2011 clothing agreement takes effect` `the completion agreement was signed on` IF
    NOT (`the completion agreement was signed on` `is on or before` `the completion agreement is due by`)

-- akn:art_3/p2 The initials at the foot of the first page; no rule.
-- akn:art_3/p3 A fax banner; no rule.

-- (א): the allowance is paid again by the rules in force on the eve of this
-- agreement (NOTHING here: the corpus does not hold them).
@ref akn:art_3__para_a
GIVEN `paid with the salary of` IS A DATE, `the completion agreement was signed on` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the clothing level by the 2011 agreement` `paid with the salary of` `the completion agreement was signed on` IS
    IF `§3 of the 2011 clothing agreement takes effect` `the completion agreement was signed on`
    THEN NOTHING
    ELSE `the clothing level by §2 of 2011` `paid with the salary of`

-- (ב): a teacher paid level 4 in July 2011 under this agreement though his
-- seniority had not reached 25 years repays the difference between level 4
-- and level 3, and the State may set it off from his salary, subject to the
-- Wage Protection Law (outside the corpus).
@ref akn:art_3__para_b
GIVEN `seniority in years` IS A NUMBER, `level 4's amount` IS A NUMBER, `level 3's amount` IS A NUMBER, `the completion agreement was signed on` IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the July 2011 clothing difference to repay` `seniority in years` `level 4's amount` `level 3's amount` `the completion agreement was signed on` IS
    IF `§3 of the 2011 clothing agreement takes effect` `the completion agreement was signed on` AND `seniority in years` LESS THAN 25
    THEN `level 4's amount` MINUS `level 3's amount`
    ELSE 0

`repaying the July 2011 clothing difference` MEANS
    PARTY `the teaching employee`
    MUST  `repay the July 2011 clothing difference`

`setting off the July 2011 clothing difference` MEANS
    PARTY `the State`
    MAY   `set off the July 2011 clothing difference from the salary`

`why the Wage Protection Law is not in the 2011 clothing agreement` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "חוק הגנת השכר, התשי\"ח-1958"

§§ `4–5 מיצוי ושקט תעשייתי`

-- §4: a full and final exhaustion of the parties' claims on the matter it
-- settles. §5: neither side strikes or locks out over it.
@ref akn:art_4 akn:art_4/p1
`the 2011 clothing agreement exhausts the claims on the clothing level` MEANS TRUE

@ref akn:art_5 akn:art_5/p1
`industrial peace over the 2011 clothing allowance` MEANS
    PARTY `the teachers' union`
    SHANT `strike over the 2011 clothing allowance`

`the State's industrial peace over the 2011 clothing allowance` MEANS
    PARTY `the State`
    SHANT `lock out over the 2011 clothing allowance`

-- akn:conclusions The sign-off: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:conclusions/p1 The signing formula; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/p2 The signatures; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/t1 The parties signing; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/p3 A fax banner; no rule.

§§ `examples`

-- Level 4 from the allowance of July 2011, whatever the seniority; before
-- it, the old rules. Had the completion agreement been signed after
-- 30.6.2012, the old rules again, and a teacher under 25 years repays July's
-- difference (placeholders 1,000 and 800); signed by then, nothing.
#ASSERT `the clothing level by §2 of 2011` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 7 2011) EQUALS JUST 4
#ASSERT `the clothing level by §2 of 2011` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2011) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `the clothing level by the 2011 agreement` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2012) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 7 2012) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `the clothing level by the 2011 agreement` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2012) (DATE_FROM_DMY 30 6 2012) EQUALS JUST 4
#ASSERT `the July 2011 clothing difference to repay` 10 1000 800 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 7 2012) EQUALS 200
#ASSERT `the July 2011 clothing difference to repay` 30 1000 800 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 7 2012) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the July 2011 clothing difference to repay` 10 1000 800 (DATE_FROM_DMY 30 6 2012) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the 2011 clothing agreement applies to` TRUE TRUE
